<p>In June 2000, Marcelo Nicchio began working at <strong>PSINet</strong>, a multinational connectivity and infrastructure company operating through the height — and imminent collapse — of the dot-com bubble. His connection to the business went much further back: he had first encountered it as an SP Online customer during the BBS era.</p>
<!-- thread-media:psinet:start -->
